  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting a green future: Forestry and Conservation for a sustainable economic development in Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action aims at contributing to environmental protection through sustainable use and conservation of natural resources in Liberia, enhancing interventions against climate change and climate adaptation, and focusing on meaningful job creation and income generation in the forestry sector. It builds on actions that are already under implementation (VPA/FLEGT, PAPFOR, TVET), which will be reinforced, enlarged and expanded, and will serve as sound basis for the development this programme.</narrative>
  </description>
